    "snippet": "- Slight chances for isolated showers and thunderstorms are possible across South Central Arizona through Thursday afternoon. This will be sufficient to support isolated showers and thunderstorms across South-Central AZ this afternoon, with better chances focused towards the south/east of Phoenix.",
